do_1 = "Implement [design] navigation_runtime without prefetch: client/link.tsx exports Link from @sidioralabs/rex/client rendering a[data-rex-nav] with the href of pageHref for a page declaration or a page id, validating params in dev (a REX3xx outcome, a plain href in production), navigating through useRouteChange with the target's transition and by document under REX_STATIC_HOST (client/static-host.ts); nav.to, nav.href and nav.replace accept a page id typed by the RexPageId union that vite/app-module.ts writes into the rex:app typings (vite/rex-app.d.ts); the header back control and the recovery control in body.tsx render through Link with the params nav.back() carries and the Frame keeps receiving them as links; RexRoutes scrolls to the top or the URL hash after a push or replace with history.scrollRestoration manual and restores the saved position on traverse, with scroll false threaded from nav.to and Link and no smooth scrolling under agent density."
