do_1 = "Implement [design] cache_pipeline: server/middleware/cache.ts, registered in server/middleware.ts, derives Cache-Control and Vary after the route from x-rex-render, x-rex-static, the page's render and revalidate and the actor, overriding the no-store the render and text routes set today (render.ts stops setting it); routes/manifest.ts answers an ETag computed once from the manifest body with the Web Crypto API and 304 on If-None-Match; adapters/node.ts serves hashed files under /assets/ with public, max-age=31536000, immutable and no-cache otherwise; vite/outputs/headers.ts writes dist/client/_headers with the same table for the static target; build.ts prints the cache table beside the chunk table."
do_2 = "usesStaticPages includes edge so rex build --target edge runs prerenderBuild and writes dist/prerender.json, which the edge entry imports at build time; server/adapters/edge.ts gains cacheStaticStore over the Cache API and installEdgeStaticPages(registry, { list, store }) mirroring installNodeStaticPages, and static-cache.ts gains an after(promise) option the edge entry binds to executionCtx.waitUntil per request so a stale regeneration survives the response, with the same x-rex-static statuses as node; security.forwarded makes requestOrigin read X-Forwarded-Proto and X-Forwarded-Host for the Origin check, CORS and createRexContext."
