do_1 = "Implement [design] i18n_pipeline: vite/prerender.ts expands every path once per locale under prefix routing, renders with the locale from the path, records locale on StaticPageEntry (prerender list version 2, parsed with the version 1 fallback) and prints the locale on each line; vite/outputs/locale-chooser.ts writes the root document with one data-rex-nav link per locale carrying lang and hreflang and a meta refresh to the default; adapters/static-cache.ts keys entries by path and locale and sets Content-Language; server/middleware/locale.ts, registered in server/middleware.ts, answers 307 to the resolved locale for an unprefixed document request under prefix routing and sets Content-Language and merges Accept-Language and Cookie into Vary whenever i18n is configured; server/routes/locale.ts sets the rex-locale cookie by form post under routing none."
do_2 = "client/shell/locale-slot.tsx, registered in client/shell/slots.ts and lazy like the density switcher, renders one control per locale with data-rex-locale, lang and aria-pressed as links under prefix routing and as a form post under none; the palette lists Switch to <name> entries and ?locale= switches like ?density=; client/i18n/defaults.ts holds the rex.* English defaults consulted after the app's files by resolveMessage, and the header back label, the palette placeholder, the confirmation dialog and the not-found title in the header move to msg:rex.* keys; server/form.ts writes lang and the localized copy of the confirmation and error pages from the request locale; i18n.direction sets dir on the document and the provider mirrors documentElement.dir; check/rules/i18n.ts gains i18n/missing-key, i18n/locale-parity and i18n/static-locale and reads placeholder, alt and aria-description."
do_3 = "Tests: prerender.test.ts per locale and the chooser, static-cache tests for the locale key, middleware/locale.test.ts for the redirect and headers, routes/locale.test.ts, form.test.tsx for lang and copy, i18n tests for the defaults chain, the direction and the switcher, locale-slot.test.tsx and palette.test.ts for the addresses and the sidecar entries, i18n.test.ts with a fixture under check/fixtures/i18n naming each finding; docs/recipes/i18n.md gains the static site section, the switcher and the rules; docs/agent-contract.md documents data-rex-locale and the sidecar locale fields; the demo's locale region moves to the shell switcher in the demo task."
