do_1 = "Implement [design] invalidation on the server: server/cache.ts memoryCache() and the Cache interface (get, set, purge by action id and scope) with createRexServer cache?: Cache in server/app.ts; actionProcedure in server/router.ts wraps a read action with cache after the policy check keyed by action id, input digest and actor id or locale by scope, writes the audit record with cached true on a hit (server/audit.ts), and after a successful mutating run purges the server cache of every read action in invalidates and asks staticCacheFor(registry).invalidate(paths) (new on StaticCache: marks the entries of every prerendered page whose loaders loaderInvalidatedBy matches as stale, regenerates in the background through the in-flight map, returns the paths) recording the paths on the audit record; static entries regenerate through the zero-JS renderer the node entry registers (server/node.ts); page.fallback render makes serve() generate, store and list an unlisted path on the first miss and not-found answers 404 without rendering; check/rules/render.ts gains render/regenerate-unreachable (warning) for a page whose loader an action invalidates while the build target cannot regenerate it."
do_2 = "Implement the client side: client/act.ts onMutate cancels, snapshots and sets every loader query that loaderInvalidatedBy matches through action.optimistic, onError restores, onSettled invalidates as today; client/loaders.ts exposes the matching helper; client/page.tsx Region carries data-rex-optimistic while an optimistic value is shown and client/agent/sidecar.tsx writes optimistic: true on the region entry, both cleared on settle; check/runtime.ts asserts the attribute clears after settle."
do_3 = "Tests: cache.test.ts, router.test.ts (hit, miss, purge, audit record, regeneration call), audit.test.ts, app.test.ts, the static-cache tests for invalidate() and the fallback, node.test.ts, act.test.tsx and loaders.test.tsx for the optimistic cycle, page.test.tsx and sidecar.test.tsx for the attribute and the entry, render.test.ts for the warning, runtime.test.ts; docs/recipes/loader.md gains the cache, regeneration, fallback and optimistic sections; docs/primitives.md Actions section documents cache and optimistic."
