do_1 = "Implement [decision] templates and [design] site_template: cli/gen/site.ts contributes the site generator set selected by rex new <name> --template site (default app) through cli/generators.ts, writing the config, scripts, index.html without a title (the app template drops its title too since Rex owns it), the docs collection with its entity, data module and two read actions, the home, doc and not-found pages, the docs frame in app/components/Shell.tsx, the mark, the Playwright projects and e2e/operability.spec.ts over walkPage, vitest.config.ts and a page test per page; cli/gen/example.ts implements --example <name|github-url> fetching a folder of the repository examples through the fetch helper pattern of cli/designx.ts then installing; --host <host> fills deploy.host and the package.json start script per target (bun, deno, node) and --no-git is honoured."
do_2 = "Tests: new.test.ts and commands/new.test.ts build every template (rex check exits 0, rex build --target static for site writes every page, 404.html, sitemap.xml, robots.txt, llms.txt and index.md per page, rex build for app), gen/site.test.ts and gen/example.test.ts; docs/cli.md documents --template, --example and --host; docs/tutorial.md gains the site path; README.md quick start names both templates; site/README.md records that site/ stays the hand-built reference the template mirrors."
